  {
   "id": "nn garch model",
   "nombre_canonico": "NN-GARCH model",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "NN-GARCH model"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    88
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Modelo conjunto de red neuronal (Feedforward) y GARCH que captura tanto las no linealidades en la dinámica de la media de la corrección de errores (mispricings) como los efectos de agrupamiento de volatilidad (ARCH).",
     "doc_id": 88
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "In our approach, we attempt to model both nonlinearities in the correction of mispricings as well as volatility clustering effects. For this purpose, we use a recently proposed class of joint neural networkGARCH models[15] that is intended to capture both effects.",
     "doc_id": 88
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
